+---
+
+### 7. **CI/CD Pipeline** (GitHub Actions) ⭐ P1
+**Ubicación**: `.github/workflows/`
+
+**Workflows** (9/12 implementados):
+
+| Workflow | Trigger | Jobs | Estado |
