+## 📊 Monitoring & Observability
+
+### Prometheus Métricas (integradas)
+
+```yaml
+# infrastructure/thingsdata/prometheus-thingsdata.yml
+global:
+  scrape_interval: 15s
+
+scrape_configs:
+  - job_name: 'thingsdata'
+    static_configs:
+      - targets: ['localhost:8080']
+    metrics_path: '/api/v1/metrics'
+
+  - job_name: 'mosquitto'
